    "body": "Thanks @junov, that looks like it could make sense. Would it match the timing of `HTMLCanvasElement::notifyListenersCanvasChanged` in Blink?\n\nHowever, any \"for each element in the document\" phrasing would exclude elements not attached, I guess that isn't your intention given what you later wrote?\n",
