    "updated_at": "2016-03-24T15:01:52Z",
    "body": "\"In a document\" has a particular meaning, meaning a node who's root is the document. So yeah, you want wording like \"For each canvas element whose node document is document, ...\".\n\nSuch an API is not available to developers by the way, enumerating nodes whose node document is a particular document. That would make garbage collection a whole lot harder. How is that handled here? If you have a listener you'll be kept alive? We'll need to define that.\n",
