    "updated_at": "2016-03-29T04:34:28Z",
    "body": "OK, so I think that for starters, just notifying the elements that are actually in the document sounds like a good idea, and when some implementation wants to do more the spec can follow along. Is anyone keen to write a PR for this?\n",
