    "created_at": "2018-01-30T07:38:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-30T07:38:18Z",
    "body": "@uysalere I think what's lacking is a \"canvas capture stream list\" concept on documents that we can iterate over. And something we can explicitly invoke with a canvas element each rendering loop. So we can have language like this in HTML:\r\n\r\n> 1. For each _canvas_ in _document_'s [canvas capture stream list], invoke [capture canvas frame] with _canvas_. [[MEDIACAPTURE]]",
